{
  "_about": [
    "Mano Colony asset list. scripts/colony-assets.py reads the untouched originals in ./originals,",
    "cleans the alpha (the sheets ship with ~250 alpha inside and faint 1-60 alpha noise around),",
    "cuts every object out by its own connected pixels (not a blind even grid), scales it to the",
    "game size below and packs the results into src/colony/assets/<folder>/.",
    "cells: [row, col] in the sheet's grid -> output name. world: target size in world px",
    "(1 tile = 32 world px); outputs are stored at 2x for sharp phones."
  ],
  "scale": 2,
